hadiths[17]{hadithnumber,text}:
"940","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen khabar di jabke Aap apne muazzaz sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) ki ek jama'at mein the. Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab Allah ne aasmanon aur zameen ko paida farmaya, Us ne «صور» ko paida farmaya aur use Israfil (Alaihissalam) ko diya. To us ne use apne munh par rakha hai aur apni nigaah Arsh ki taraf jhukae hue hai, intezar mein ke kab use hukm diya jayega (taake woh us mein phoonke).' Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main ne poocha: Ya Rasulullah! «صور» kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Seeng hai.' Main ne poocha: Us ki kaifiyat kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh azeem cheez hai. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Us ke munh ka ghera aasmanon aur zameen ki chaudai jitna hai. Allah Israfil ko us mein teen martaba phoonkne ka hukm dega: pahli phoonk «نفخة فزع» (ghabrahat) hai, doosri «نفخة صعق» (behosh karne wali) hai, aur teesri phoonk Rabbul Aalameen ke samne khade hone ke liye hogi. Allah Israfil ko hukm dega aur farmayega: «نفخة فزع» phoonko. To jo aasmanon aur zameen mein hain sab ghabra jayenge siwae jise Allah chahe. Phir Woh use hukm dega, aur woh use baghair kisi waqfe ya takheer ke phoonkta rahega. Is ke bare mein Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Woh sirf ek cheekh ka intezar karte hain jis mein koi waqfa nahin hai. Phir Allah pahadon ko chalayega; woh badalon ki manind chalenge, phir mitti ho jayenge; phir zameen apne rehne walon samet shadeed zalzale se hilegi — Allah Ta'ala ne is kaifiyat ko bayan farmaya hai: Us din zalzala zalzala karega, aur us ke baad doosra zalzala aayega. Us din dil kaanp rahe honge. Phir zameen toofani samandar mein kashti ki manind hogi: maujen use takrayengi aur use us ke sawaron samet ulta dengi; ya Arsh se latke charagh ki manind jise hawayen hilayengi. Log peeth ke bal girenge; doodh pilane waliyan hosh kho dengi; hamila aurten hamal gira dengi; bachche budhe ho jayenge; shaitan bhagenge yahan tak ke kinaron tak pahunchenge, phir farishte un se milenge aur un ke chehron par marenge, aur woh wapas lautenge. Log bhagenge ek doosre ko pukarte hue. Is ke bare mein Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Pukarne ka din (Qayamat), jis din tum peeth pher kar bhagoge, tumhare liye Allah se koi bachane wala nahin hoga; aur jise Allah gumrah kare us ke liye koi hadayat dene wala nahin hai. Jabke woh is haalat mein honge, zameen ek kinare se doosre kinare tak phat jayegi, aur woh azeem waqiya dekhenge; unhen bechaini aur khauf gher lega jis ki miqdar Allah janta hai. Phir aasman bhus ki manind ho jayega, aur woh ek kinare se doosre kinare tak phat jayega. Phir suraj aur chaand apni roshni kho denge, aur sitare girenge, aur aasman un se hata diya jayega.' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Murde is mein se kuch nahin janenge.' Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main ne poocha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah ke qaul mein istisna ke bare mein: 'To jo aasmanon aur zameen mein hain sab ghabra jayenge siwae jise Allah chahe' — use kis ko istisna diya jayega? Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh shuhada hain; woh apne Rabb ke paas zinda hain. Yeh khauf zindon tak pahunchega, to Allah unhen us din ke khauf se mahfooz rakhega; aur woh Allah ka azab hai jo Woh apni makhlooq mein se badtareen par bhejega. Is ke bare mein Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Aey logon! Apne Rabb se daro; beshak Qayamat ka zalzala azeem cheez hai. Jis din tum use dekhoge, har doodh pilane wali apne doodh peete bachche ko bhool jayegi, aur har hamila aurat hamal gira degi, aur tum logon ko nashay mein dekho ge halanke woh nashay mein nahin honge; lekin Allah ka azab sakht hai.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh is aazmaish mein utni muddat rahenge jitni Allah chahega, lekin yeh muddat lambi hogi. Phir Allah Israfil (Alaihissalam) ko «نفخة صعق» ke bare mein hukm dega. To jo aasmanon aur zameen mein hain sab behosh ho jayenge siwae jise Allah chahe; aur woh bejaan ho jayenge. Malakul maut Jabbar (Allah Ta'ala) ke samne aayega aur kahega: Aey Rabb! Jo aasmanon aur zameen mein hain sab mar gae siwae jinhen Tu ne chaha. Allah use farmayega — halanke Woh behtar janta hai: Kaun baqi raha? Woh kahega: Aey Rabb! Tu Zinda hai jo kabhi nahin marta, Tere Arsh ke uthane wale, Jibreel aur Mika'il, aur main baqi hun. Allah farmayega: Jibreel aur Mika'il ko maut do. Phir Arsh bolega aur kahega: Aey Rabb! Kya Tu Jibreel aur Mika'il ko bhi maut dega? Allah farmayega: Khamosh! Jo Mere Arsh ke neeche hai, main ne us ke liye maut muqaddar farmai hai. To woh donon mar jayenge. Phir malakul maut Jabbar ke samne aayega aur kahega: Aey Rabb! Jibreel aur Mika'il mar gae. Allah use farmayega — halanke Woh behtar janta hai: Kaun baqi raha? Woh kahega: Tu Zinda hai jo kabhi nahin marta, Tere Arsh ke uthane wale, aur main baqi hun. Allah farmayega: Mere Arsh ke uthane walon ko maut do. To woh mar jayenge. Allah use farmayega — halanke Woh behtar janta hai: Kaun baqi raha? Woh kahega: Tu Zinda hai jo kabhi nahin marta, aur main baqi hun. Allah farmayega: Tum Meri makhlooq mein se ek ho; main ne tumhen us ke liye paida kiya jo tum ne dekha. To mar jao. Phir woh mar jayega. Jab sirf Allah, Wahid, Qahhar, Samad baqi rahega — jis ki koi aulad nahin — Woh waisa hi rahega jaisa ibtida aur intiha mein tha. Woh farmayega: Ab «خلود» (baqa) hai; na Ahle Jannat ke liye maut hai na Ahle Jahannam ke liye. Phir Allah Ta'ala farmayega: Aaj badshahi kis ki hai? Badshahi kis ki hai? Koi Use jawab nahin dega. Phir Woh Khud se farmayega: Allah Wahid Qahhar ki. Phir Allah aasmanon aur zameen ko Kitab ke tumar ki manind lapetega; phir Allah aasmanon aur zameen ko doosri zameen se badal dega; phir Woh unhen phailayega, phir unhen pakdega, phir farmayega: Main Jabbar hun. Phir Woh aasmanon aur zameen ko doosri zameen se badal dega, phir unhen phailayega, phir unhen pakdega, aur teen martaba farmayega: Main Jabbar hun. Jis ne Mere sath shareek ka da'wa kiya woh aae! Suno: jis ne Mere sath shareek ka da'wa kiya woh aae! Koi nahin aayega. Phir Woh use Ukaz ke kamaye chamde ki manind bichhayega; aur us mein koi tedh ya teela (na hamwari) nahin hogi. Phir Allah makhlooq ko datega, aur is tabdeeli mein woh apni pichli jagahon ki haalat mein honge; jo us ke pet mein tha woh us ke pet mein hoga, aur jo us ki peeth par tha woh us ki peeth par hoga. Phir Allah un par Arsh ke neeche se pani barsayega; aur un par chalees din barish hogi; aur woh khumbi aur sabziyon ki manind ugenge, yahan tak ke jab un ke jism jaise the waise mukammal ho jayenge to Allah Ta'ala farmayega: Arsh ke uthane wale zinda ho jayen. To woh zinda ho jayenge. Phir Woh farmayega: Jibreel aur Mika'il zinda ho jayen. To woh donon zinda ho jayenge. Phir Allah Israfil ko hukm dega: «نفخة بعث» (uthaye jane ka soor) phoonko. To woh «نفخة بعث» phoonkega; aur roohen jhund ki makkhiyon ki manind niklengi, zameen aur aasman ke darmiyan bhar jayengi. Jabbar farmayega: Meri izzat aur jalal ki qasam! Har rooh ko apne jism mein wapas aana chahiye. To roohen zameen mein jismon mein dakhil hongi; phir naak ke nathnon mein bahengi jaise zahar zahreele janwar ke dase hue ke jism mein bahta hai. Phir zameen un par phat jayegi. Aur zameen sab se pahle mujh par phategi, phir tum jaldi nikloge, apne Rabb ki taraf daudte hue; aur us waqt tum sab tees saal ke hoge, aur zaban «سريانية» hogi. Tum aajizi se aaoge, sar uthae hue, pukarne wale ki taraf daudte hue. Kafir kahenge: Yeh sakht din hai. Yeh nikalne (qabron se) ka din hai. Woh ek jagah jama kiye jayenge; aur un ke thehrne ki muddat sattar saal hogi; aur woh nange paon, nange badan, ghair makhtoon honge. Na tumhen dekha jayega aur na tumhare darmiyan faisla kiya jayega. Makhlooq roegi yahan tak ke aansu khatm ho jayenge, phir woh khoon royegi. Woh paseene mein sharabor hogi yahan tak ke un mein se baaz ka paseena un ki thoddiyon tak pahunchega; aur woh un par lagam ki manind hoga. Phir woh pukaren ge: Hamare Rabb se hamare liye kaun sifarish karega taake Woh hamare darmiyan faisla farmaye? Woh kahenge: Tumhare walid Adam (Alaihissalam) se ziyada is ka haqdar kaun hai? Allah ne unhen Apne hath se paida farmaya, un mein Apni rooh phoonki, aur un se barah rast guftagu farmai. Woh Adam (Alaihissalam) ke paas aayenge aur un se darkhwast karenge, lekin woh inkar karenge.' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yahan tak ke woh mere paas aayenge. Jab woh mere paas aayenge to main «حوض» ki taraf chalunga aur Arsh ke samne sajda karunga. Phir mera Rabb mere paas ek farishta bhejega jo mujhe bazu se pakad kar uthayega.' Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main ne poocha: Ya Rasulullah! «الفحص» se kya murad hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Arsh ke samne.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah farmayega: Aey Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Tumhari kya fikr hai? — halanke Woh behtar janta hai. Main kahunga: Aey Rabb! Tu ne mujh se shafa'at ka wa'da farmaya tha; to meri shafa'at Apni makhlooq ke bare mein qabool farma aur un ke darmiyan faisla farma.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah farmayega: Main tumhare paas aaunga aur tumhare darmiyan faisla karunga.' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Phir main wapas aunga aur logon ke sath khada hunga. Jabke ham khade honge, achanak ham aasman se sakht awaz sunenge jo hamen darayegi. Sab se neeche aasman ke rehne wale — hazir jinn o ins se dogne — nazil honge. Jab woh zameen ke qareeb aayenge to zameen un ke noor se roshan ho jayegi; aur woh safen banayenge. Ham un se kahenge: Kya hamara Rabb tum mein hai? Woh kahenge: Nahin, lekin Woh aa raha hai. Phir teesre aasman ke farishte — hazir jinn o ins se dogne ki tadad mein — nazil honge. Jab woh zameen ke qareeb aayenge to zameen un ke noor se roshan ho jayegi; aur woh safen banayenge. Ham un se kahenge: Kya hamara Rabb tum mein hai? Woh kahenge: Nahin, lekin Woh aa raha hai. Phir har aasman se, isi izafe ke sath, aasmanon ke tamam farishte nazil honge yahan tak ke Jabbar badalon aur farishton ke sae mein nazil hoga; aur aath farishte Us ka Arsh uthayenge. Us din woh chaar honge; un ke paon sab se neeche zameen ki hadon par, aasman aur zameenen un ke tehband bandhne ki jagah par, aur Arsh un ke kandhon par. Un ki tasbeeh se shor hoga; aur un ki tasbeeh ke alfaz honge: «سبحانك ذي الملك ذي الملكوت، سبحان رب العرش ذي الجبروت، سبحان رب الملائكة والروح، قدوس، سبحان ربنا الأعلى، سبحان رب الملكوت والجبروت والكبرياء، والسلطان والعظمة، سبحانه أبد الآبد، سبحان الحي الذي لا يموت، سبحان الذي يميت الخلائق ولا يموت». Phir Allah Apna Arsh zameen par jahan chahega rakhega. Woh farmayega: Meri izzat aur jalal ki qasam! Aaj, Mere sath zulm se koi baqi nahin rahega. Phir Woh aisi awaz se pukarega jo tamam makhlooq sunegi. Woh farmayega: Jab se main ne tumhen paida kiya, main tumhare liye khamosh raha. Main tumhare a'mal dekhta aur tumhari baten sunta raha. To ab, Mere liye khamosh raho. Yeh tumhare a'malname aur tumhare a'mal hain jo tumhen padh kar sunaye jayenge. Jo khair pae, Allah ki hamd kare; aur jo us ke siwa pae, sirf apne nafs ko malamat kare. Phir Allah jahannam ko hukm dega; aur us mein se ek gardan niklegi, kahegi: Aey mujrimon! Aaj alag ho jao. Kya main ne tum se ahad nahin liya tha... (yahan tak ke) qaul: Us (shaitan) ne tum mein se bahuton ko gumrah kiya. Kya tum aql se kaam nahin lete?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah apni tamam makhlooq ke darmiyan faisla farmayega siwae jinn o ins ke; aur un ke darmiyan badla lega, yahan tak ke Woh seeng wali ke liye be seeng wali se badla lega. Jab kisi ka doosre par koi da'wa baqi nahin rahega to Allah Ta'ala farmayega: Mitti ho jao! Us waqt kafir kahega: Kaash main mitti hota! Phir Allah jinn o ins ke darmiyan faisla farmayega. Sab se pahla faisla khoon (qatl) ka hoga. Duniya mein qatl karne wala laya jayega jo Allah ki Kitab aur hukm ke mutabiq qatl karta tha, aur maqtool laya jayega, us ka sar utha hua, us ki ragon se khoon bahta hua. Woh kahenge: Aey hamare Rabb! Is shakhs ne mujhe qatl kiya. Allah use farmayega — halanke Woh behtar janta hai: Tum ne use kyun qatl kiya? Woh kahega: Main ne use is liye qatl kiya taake izzat aur ghalba Tere liye ho. Allah farmayega: Tum ne sach kaha. Allah us ka chehra suraj ki manind chamkayega; aur farishte use jannat tak sath le jayenge. Phir duniya mein qatl karne wala laya jayega jo ghalbe ke liye qatl karta tha, Allah ke hukm se nahin; aur maqtool laya jayega, us ka sar utha hua, us ki ragon se khoon bahta hua. Woh (maqtool) kahenge: Aey hamare Rabb! Us ne hamen qatl kiya. Allah use farmayega — halanke Woh behtar janta hai: Tum ne unhen kyun qatl kiya? Woh kahega: Main ne unhen is liye qatl kiya taake izzat aur ghalba mere liye ho. Allah farmayega: Tum tabah ho, tabah. Allah us ka chehra siyah farmayega aur us ki aankhen neeli. Har jaan ke badle jo us ne qatl ki, use badle mein qatl kiya jayega. Phir Allah apni baqi makhlooq ke darmiyan faisla farmayega, yahan tak ke Woh us se taqaza farmayega jis ne pani ko doodh se milaya ke woh pani ko doodh se alag kare. Jab kisi ki doosre par koi zimmedari baqi nahin rahegi to tamam makhlooq ko pukarne wala elan karega: Suno! Har qaum jo Allah ke siwa kisi ki ibadat karti thi, apne mabud se ja mile. Jo Allah ke siwa kisi ki ibadat karta tha use us ke mabud ki surat mein banaya jayega aur us ke samne pesh kiya jayega. Us din ek farishte ko Uzair (Alaihissalam) ki shakl di jayegi, aur Yahudi us ki pairwi karenge; aur ek farishte ko Isa (Alaihissalam) ki shakl di jayegi, aur Nasara us ki pairwi karenge. Phir un ke mabud unhen jahannam ki taraf le jayenge. Is ke bare mein Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Agar woh (sachche) mabud hote to us mein dakhil na hote.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Phir Allah un ke paas jis rob mein chahega aayega aur farmayega: Aey logon! Log chale gae. Jinhen tum Allah ke siwa poojte the un se ja milo. Woh kahenge: Hamara Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin hai; ham sirf Usi ki ibadat karte the. To Woh un se alag ho jayega, aur Allah un mein hoga. Phir Woh un ke paas jis rob mein chahega aayega aur farmayega: Aey logon! Jinhen tum Allah ke siwa poojte the un se apne mabudon ke sath ja milo. Woh kahenge: Ham sirf Allah ki ibadat karte the. Woh farmayega: Main tumhara Rabb hun. Kya tumhare aur tumhare Rabb ke darmiyan koi nishani hai jis se tum Use pahchante ho?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Phir pindli se parda uthaya jayega; aur Allah ki azmat un par zahir hogi jis se woh pahchanenge ke Wohi un ka Rabb hai. To woh sajde mein girenge; aur Allah munafiqon ki peethen bail ki seengon ki manind sakht kar dega, to woh peeth ke bal girenge. Phir Allah unhen sar uthane ki ijazat dega; aur jahannam ke donon kinaron ke darmiyan baal se bareek ya talwar se tez pul rakha jayega. Us par kante aur khaar honge jaise Sa'dan ghaas ke kante. Woh phisalne wala pul hoga. Woh use palak jhapakne, bijli, hawa, tez ghodon, oonton, aur tez mardon ki manind uboor karenge. Baaz sahi salamat uboor karenge, aur baaz zakhmi honge lekin kamyab honge. Allah ki makhlooq mein se bahut jahannam mein girenge, apne a'mal se halak honge. Baaz ko aag paon tak pakdegi aur us se aage nahin, baaz ko aadhi pindli tak, baaz ko kamar tak, aur baaz ko aag poori tarah gher legi siwae un ke chehron ke. Allah ne aag ko chehre ko chhoone se haraam farmaya hai, to woh mahfooz hoga. Jab Ahle Jannat jannat ki taraf aur Ahle Jahannam jahannam ki taraf badhenge to woh kahenge: Hamare Rabb se hamare liye kaun sifarish karega taake Woh hamen jannat mein dakhil farmaye?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh kahenge: Tumhare walid Adam (Alaihissalam) se ziyada is ka haqdar kaun hai? Allah ne unhen Apne hath se paida farmaya, un mein Apni rooh phoonki, aur un se barah rast guftagu farmai. To woh Adam (Alaihissalam) ke paas aayenge aur un se darkhwast karenge, lekin woh inkar karenge: Nuh (Alaihissalam) ke paas jao, kyunke woh Allah ke pahle Rasool hain. To woh Nuh (Alaihissalam) ke paas jayenge aur un se darkhwast karenge, lekin woh kuch yaad karenge aur kahenge: Main is ke laiq nahin hun. Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ke paas jao, kyunke Allah ne unhen Apna khaleel banaya. To woh Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ke paas aayenge aur un se darkhwast karenge, lekin woh kahenge: Main is ke laiq nahin hun. Musa (Alaihissalam) ke paas jao, kyunke Allah ne un se guftagu farmai aur unhen Taurat nazil farmai. To woh Musa (Alaihissalam) ke paas aayenge aur un se darkhwast karenge, lekin woh kahenge: Main is ke laiq nahin hun. Ruhullah aur Us ke Kalime, Isa bin Maryam (Alaihissalam) ke paas jao. To woh Isa (Alaihissalam) ke paas jayenge aur un se darkhwast karenge, lekin woh kahenge: Main is ke laiq nahin hun, lekin main tumhari rahnumai karunga: Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jao.' Aap ne farmaya: 'To woh mere paas aayenge; aur mere Rabb ke paas meri teen shafa'aten hain jinka Us ne mujh se wa'da farmaya hai.' Aap ne farmaya: 'To main jannat mein aunga aur darwaze ke halqe (handle) ko pakdunga aur kholne ka sawal karunga; aur woh mere liye khola jayega. Mujhe salam aur khush aamdeed kaha jayega; aur main jannat mein dakhil hunga. Jab main us mein dakhil hunga to main apne Rabb ko Us ke Arsh par dekhunga aur utni der sajde mein girunga jitni Allah chahega. Allah mujhe hamd aur tasbeeh ke kalime sikhayega jo Us ne apni makhlooq mein se kisi ko nahin sikhaye. Phir Woh farmayega: Aey Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Apna sar uthao; shafa'at karo, tumhari shafa'at qabool hogi; mango, tumhen diya jayega. Main kahunga: Aey Rabb! Meri ummat, meri ummat mein se jo jahannam mein gir gae. Allah farmayega: Jao aur aag mein se use nikalo jise tum un ke chehron se pahchante ho. To woh nikale jayenge; aur jahannam mein ek bhi baqi nahin rahega. Phir Allah farmayega: Jao aur use nikalo jis ke dil mein deenar ke barabar iman ho. Phir Woh farmayega: Jo do tehayi deenar, phir aadha deenar, phir qeerat wala ho; phir jao aur use nikalo jis ke dil mein rai ke dane ke barabar iman ho.' Aap ne farmaya: 'To woh nikale jayenge aur jannat mein dakhil honge.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki jaan hai! Jab tum jannat mein dakhil hoge to tum apne maskan aur biwiyon ko us se behtar pahchanoge jitna tum unhen duniya mein pahchante the.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh niklenge; phir Allah shafa'at ke bare mein hukm farmayega; aur har nabi, shaheed, aur momin ki shafa'at qabool hogi — siwae kasrat se la'nat karne wale ke, kyunke woh shaheed nahin likha jayega aur use shafa'at ki ijazat nahin di jayegi. Phir Allah farmayega: Main Arhamur Rahimeen hun. Phir Allah jahannam mein se itne log nikalega jinki tadad sirf Woh janta hai. Woh unhen «حيوان» nami nahar mein rakhega; aur woh us mein aise ugenge jaise dana sailab ke kichad mein ugta hai. Jo dhoop mein honge woh ziyada hare honge, aur jo sae mein honge woh ziyada peele honge.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab Arbon ne yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Goya Aap dehat mein the? Phir woh apne galey sadey jismon mein cheentiyon ki manind ugenge; aur un ki gardanon par «الجهنميون» 'Rahman se aazad kiye gae' likha hoga. Ahle Jannat unhen is tehreer se pahchanenge. Woh utni muddat waise rahenge jitni Allah chahega. Phir woh kahenge: Aey hamare Rabb! Ham se yeh naam («الجهنميون») hata do. To Allah use un se hata dega.'"
"941","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aswad bin Sari' (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Qayamat ke din chaar shakhs hujjat pesh karenge: behra, bewaqoof, bahut budha, aur woh jo «فترة» (do nabiyon ke darmiyan waqfe) mein faut hua. Raha behra, woh kahega: Aey Rabb! Islam aaya lekin main kuch sun nahin saka. Aur raha bewaqoof, woh kahega: Aey Rabb! Islam aaya jabke bachche mujh par gobar phenkte the. Aur raha bahut budha, woh kahega: Aey Rabb! Islam aaya lekin mujhe samajh na thi (aur meri yaaddasht chali gai thi). Aur raha woh jo «فترة» mein faut hua, woh kahega: Aey Rabb! Tera koi rasool mere paas nahin aaya. Phir Woh un se pakka ahad lega ke woh Us ki ita'at karenge. Phir Woh un ki taraf ek rasool bhejega jo kahega: Jahannam mein dakhil ho jao.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Agar woh us mein dakhil honge to woh un ke liye thandi aur salamti ban jayegi.'"
"942","[AI-translation] Abu Rafi' se Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se pichli hadees ki manind riwayat hai, siwae is ke ke unhon ne zikr kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'To jo us mein dakhil hoga, us par aman aur thandak hogi; aur jo us mein dakhil nahin hoga use us ki taraf dhakela jayega.'"
"943","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Chaar qism ke log hain jo sab Allah se uzr ke sath hujjat aur iltija karenge: woh aadmi jo do nabiyon (Alaihimussalam) ke darmiyan waqfe mein faut hua, woh aadmi jo budhape mein faut hua, majnoon, aur behra goonga. To Allah un se farmayega: Main tumhari taraf ek rasool bhejunga; us ki ita'at karo. Phir woh un ke paas aayega aur un ke liye aag bhadkayega, phir kahega: Us mein dakhil ho jao. Jo us mein dakhil hoga, woh us ke liye thandak aur aman ban jayegi; aur jo us mein dakhil nahin hoga, us par azab ka faisla qayam hoga.'"
"944","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Log teen girohon mein jama kiye jayenge: ek tehayi sawariyon par, ek tehayi apne paon par chalte hue, aur ek tehayi apne chehron par ghaseete hue.'"
"945","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Log teen girohon mein jama kiye jayenge: ek tehayi sawariyon par, ek tehayi apne paon par chalte hue, aur ek tehayi apne chehron par ghaseete hue.' Poochha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Woh apne chehron par kaise chalenge? Aap ne farmaya: 'Jis ne unhen un ke paon par chalaya Woh unhen un ke chehron par chalane par qadir hai. Suno! Woh apne chehron par har buland jagah aur kante par chalenge.'"
"946","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sareed pesh kiya gaya; Aap ne dast ke gosht ko liya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bakri ke dast ke gosht ko bahut pasand farmate the. To Aap ne dast ki haddi se gosht apne danton se noch kar khaya aur farmaya: 'Qayamat ke din main Aulad Adam ka sardar hunga.' Jab Aap ne dekha ke Aap ke sahaba Aap se (is ke bare mein) sawal nahin kar rahe to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum kyun nahin poochhte: kaise?' Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaise? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tamam log Rabbul Aalameen ke samne khade honge; dekhne wala unhen dekh sakega, aur pukarne wale ki awaz sunai degi; suraj un ke saron ke qareeb aa jayega; us ki garmi aur shiddat un par bahut sakht hogi, aur us ka qurb un ke liye bardasht karna mushkil hoga.' Aap ne farmaya: 'To woh is bechaini aur fikr ki haalat mein honge; aur is haalat mein woh Adam (Alaihissalam) ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Aey Adam! Tum bashariyyat ke walid ho; Allah ne tumhen Apne hath se paida farmaya, farishton ko hukm diya aur unhon ne tumhen sajda kiya; apne Rabb se hamare liye shafa'at karo; kya tum hamari haalat nahin dekhte?' To Adam (Alaihissalam) kahenge: Mera Rabb aaj itna ghazabnak hai jitna na pahle kabhi hua aur na phir kabhi hoga; Us ne mujhe ek hukm diya aur main ne Us ki nafarmani ki; aur main ne shaitan ki suni; Us ne mujhe darakht se mana farmaya lekin main ne us mein kotahi ki; mujhe khauf hai ke Woh mujhe jahannam mein phenk de; mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao; mujhe apne nafs ki fikr hai. To woh Nuh (Alaihissalam) ke paas jayenge aur kahenge: Aey Nuh! Tum Allah ke Nabi aur zameen walon ki taraf Allah ke pahle Rasool ho; apne Rabb se hamare liye shafa'at karo; kya tum hamari bechaini nahin dekhte? Nuh (Alaihissalam) kahenge: Mera Rabb aaj itna ghazabnak hai jitna na pahle kabhi hua aur na phir kabhi hoga; mujhe ek dua di gai thi aur main ne use apni qaum ke khilaf istemal kiya to woh halak ho gai; mujhe khauf hai ke Woh mujhe aag mein phenk de; mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao; mujhe apne nafs ki fikr hai.' Aap ne farmaya: 'To woh Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ke paas jayenge aur kahenge: Aey Ibrahim! Tum Khalilullah ho; aasmanon aur zameen walon ne tumhari dosti (Allah ke sath) suni hai; apne Rabb se hamare liye shafa'at karo; kya tum hamari bechaini nahin dekhte? Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) kahenge: Mera Rabb aaj itna ghazabnak hai jitna na pahle kabhi hua aur na phir kabhi hoga; woh sitaron ke bare mein apne qaul: Yeh mera Rabb hai, aur un ke buton ke bare mein apne qaul: Yeh un mein sab se bada hai, aur apne qaul: Main beemar hun, ka zikr karenge (unhen yaad karenge); mujhe khauf hai ke Woh mujhe jahannam mein phenk de; mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao; mujhe apne nafs ki fikr hai.' Aap ne farmaya: 'To woh jayenge yahan tak ke Musa (Alaihissalam) ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Aey Musa! Tum Allah ke Nabi ho; Allah ne tumhen Apne paigham ke liye muntakhab farmaya aur tum se guftagu farmai; apne Rabb se hamare liye shafa'at karo; kya tum hamari bechaini nahin dekhte? Musa (Alaihissalam) kahenge: Mera Rabb aaj itna ghazabnak hai jitna na pahle kabhi hua aur na phir kabhi hoga; main ne na-haq ek jaan qatl ki; mujhe khauf hai ke Woh mujhe aag mein phenk de; mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao; mujhe apne nafs ki fikr hai.' Aap ne farmaya: 'To woh Isa (Alaihissalam) ke paas jayenge aur kahenge: Aey Isa! Tum Allah ke Nabi, Us ke Kalime, aur Us ki Rooh ho jo Us ne Maryam (Alaihassalam) mein dali; apne Rabb se hamare liye shafa'at karo; kya tum hamari bechaini nahin dekhte? Isa (Alaihissalam) kahenge: Mera Rabb aaj itna ghazabnak hai jitna na pahle kabhi hua aur na phir kabhi hoga.' Amarah (rawi) ne kaha: Main nahin janta ke unhon ne kisi laghzish (ghalti) ka zikr kiya; mujhe khauf hai ke Woh mujhe jahannam mein phenk de; mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao; mujhe apne nafs ki fikr hai. To woh mere paas aayenge aur kahenge: Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Tum Allah ke Rasool aur Khatamun Nabiyeen ho; Allah ne tumhari agli pichli laghzishen muaf farma din; apne Rabb se hamare liye shafa'at karo. Aap ne farmaya: To main jaunga aur apne Rabb ke samne Arsh ke neeche sajda karunga; aur Rabbul Aalameen mujhe aise muqam mein rakhega jahan mujh se pahle koi khada nahin hua. Woh farmayega: Muhammad, shafa'at karo, tumhari shafa'at qabool hogi; mango, tumhara sawal poora hoga. Main kahunga: Aey Rabb! Meri ummat ko najaat de, meri ummat ko najaat de. To Allah mujh se farmayega: Apni ummat mein se unhen nikalo jin par koi hisab nahin hai, aur unhen sab se dayen darwaze se dakhil karo; aur woh doosre darwazon mein logon ke shareek honge. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki jaan hai! Ek darwaze se doosre ke darmiyan ka fasla Makkah-Hajar, ya Makkah-Busra jitna hai.' Rawi ne kaha: Main nahin janta un donon mein se kaunsi Aap ne farmai."
"947","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko gosht pesh kiya gaya jabke Aap ke baaz muazzaz sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) bhi Aap ke sath the. Unhon ne Aap ko dast ka gosht pesh kiya, aur Aap bakri ke is hisse ke gosht ko bahut pasand farmate the. To Aap ne use apne danton se toda aur khaya. Phir unhon ne Ammarah wali hadees ki manind hadees zikr ki; aur Isa (Alaihissalam) ke zikr wali riwayat mein unhon ne kisi laghzish ka zikr nahin kiya. Aur zikr kiya gaya: 'Us ke donon darwaze ke sutoonon ke darmiyan ka fasla Busra-Makkah, ya Makkah-Hajar jitna hai.'"
"948","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek qabr ke paas se guzre, wahan thehre, aur khajoor ki do shakhen mangin. Aap ne ek sar ki taraf aur doosri paon ki taraf rakhi, phir farmaya: 'Mumkin hai ke jab tak un mein tari hai, Allah un ke qabr ke azab mein takhfeef farmaye.'"
"949","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Sachche aur ameen (Nabi) (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen bataya: 'Qayamat ke din sab se pahla faisla do bakriyon ke darmiyan hoga: seeng wali aur be seeng wali.'"
"950","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Insan ka har hissa gal jayega siwae kamar ki aakhri haddi ke; usi se woh dobara paida kiya jayega.'"
"951","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Zameen par chalne wali har makhlooq aur apne paron se udne wala har parinda Qayamat ke din jama kiye jayenge; phir un ke darmiyan badla liya jayega, yahan tak ke be seeng bakri ko seeng wali bakri se badla dilaya jayega. Phir kafir kahega: 'Kaash main mitti hota!' Phir Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Agar tum chaho to yeh ayat padho: 'Zameen par chalne wali koi makhlooq aur na apne paron se udne wala koi parinda magar tumhari manind ummaten hain. Ham ne Kitab mein koi cheez nahin chhodi, phir woh apne Rabb ki taraf jama kiye jayenge.'"
"952","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Baaz log mere paas Hawz Kausar par aayenge; jab woh mere qareeb aayenge aur main unhen pahchanunga to unhen mere qareeb aane se rok diya jayega. Main kahunga: Woh mere sahaba hain, mere sahaba. Kaha jayega: Tum nahin jante ke unhon ne tumhare baad deen mein kya nai cheezen nikali.'"
"953","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main kaise be khauf rahun jabke seeng wala (Israfil Alaihissalam) apna munh us par rakh chuka hai, apna chehra kaan lagae us ki taraf jhuka chuka hai, intezar mein ke kab use phoonkne ka hukm diya jayega, phir woh phoonkega?' Unhon ne poocha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap hamen kya hukm dete hain? Aap ne farmaya: 'Kaho: «حَسْبُنَا اللَّهُ وَنِعْمَ الْوَكِيلُ، عَلَى اللَّهِ تَوَكَّلْنَا» — Allah hamen kafi hai aur Woh behtareen kaarsaz hai; sirf Allah par ham ne tawakkul kiya.'"
"954","[AI-translation] Abu Salih se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main kaise be khauf...' Phir rawi ne wohi misal zikr ki."
"955","[AI-translation] Atiyyah se Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pichli (hadees) ki manind riwayat hai."
"956","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Qayamat ke din log ek maidan mein aayenge; pukarne wala unhen apni awaz suna sakega, nigaah unhen dekh sakegi. Phir ek munadi khada hoga aur elan karega: Aaj har shakhs janega ke izzat ka sab se ziyada haqdar kaun hai. Phir woh kahega: Kahan hain woh jo khushhali aur tangdasti mein Allah ki hamd karte the? To woh khade honge — aur woh thode honge — phir woh baghair hisab jannat mein dakhil honge. Phir woh elan karega: Kahan hain woh jinhen un ki tijarat aur len den Allah ke zikr se ghafil nahin karte the? To woh khade honge — aur woh thode honge — phir woh baghair hisab jannat mein dakhil honge. Phir woh dobara elan karega aur kahega: Kahan hain woh jin ke pahlu un ke bistaron se alag rahte the? To woh khade honge — aur woh thode honge — phir woh bhi baghair hisab jannat mein dakhil honge. Phir baqi logon ka hisab hoga.'"
